	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[道别返回 (0:04)|Docks]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	刀背的寒气让你指尖一缩，鹿皮布滑落在箱面上。<span class="red">雷恩收刀入鞘，倒了半杯热甜酒让你暖手。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[定神再试 (0:03)|MP Daily Wren 5]]>><<set $daily.mpDaily_wren_5 to 0>><<pass 3>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[道别返回 (0:04)|Docks]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "替他清点栈房底层的烟草 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-wren-5">>
<<set $daily.mpDaily_wren_5 to 1>>
<<if ($maths or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Wren")>><<npcincr Wren love 1>><<glove>><</if>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_wren_5")>><<money 450>><</if>>你查出一箱包装受潮并及时换上油布，雷恩爽快地塞给你一卷零钞。<span class="green">他拍着箱盖留你常来船坞坐坐。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[收好谢礼离开 (0:04)|Docks]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	箱扣的铁皮毛刺刮破了指腹，血珠沁了出来。<span class="red">雷恩掏出随身创可贴利落地替你包好手指。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gtiredness>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[退回日常去处 (0:04)|Docks]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
